Package: cloudguard
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Multi-cloud configuration review, comparison and dashboarding
 CloudGuard scans AWS, Azure, GCP and OCI environments read-only against a
 CIS-focused catalog of 320+ hand-written checks, and produces a fully
 offline HTML dashboard with:
   - risk scoring and per-severity breakdown
   - CIS Benchmark score + SOC 2 / PCI DSS / NIST 800-53 / HIPAA control
     mappings on every finding
   - baseline comparison / review / drift workflow (previous report vs now)
   - false-positive exclusion in PDF / Excel / CSV exports
   - least-privilege access templates per provider
 .
 The .deb bundles its own Python virtualenv (built with dh-virtualenv), so
 every cloud SDK ships inside the package and the installed tool works
 offline with no pip installs.
